000億トンか（生産量はその倍の6,000億トンほど？） |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 9 | 　・世界の約70%の人口をカバーする国の,回答の合計が、2,200億トン/年 (右図) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 10 | 　・日本は、全体（産業と生活排水計）での排水処理量が、150億トン/年と記載 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 12 | https://www.unwater.org/sites/default/files/2024-08/SDG6_Indicator_Report_631_Progress-on-Wastewater-Treatment_2024_EN_0.pdf ([出典](https://www.unwater.org/sites/default/files/2024-08/SDG6_Indicator_Report_631_Progress-on-Wastewater-Treatment_2024_EN_0.pdf)) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 15 |  |  |  |  |  | 219612.46999999994 | 8293.1 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 17 |  |  |  | Ratio of wastewater / treated (%) |  | Wastewater treated / (Million m^{3} /year) |  | Wastewater generated / (Million m^{3} /year) |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 18 | Country | Year | Data source | Total wastewater | Industrial | Total wastewater | Industrial | Total wastewater | Private households | Services | Construction | Water collection, / treatment, supply | Production and / distribution of / electricity (excluding / cooling water) | Manufacturing / industries | Mining and quarrying | Agriculture, forestry, / fishing | 対象外(データなし) | 産業処理量入力あり | 処理された産業排水の全体処理量に対する割合 | 平均算出に含める | 列追加用ダミー |\n| 19 | Albania | 2021 | Eurostat | 0.49 |  | 36 |  | 73.5 | 71.4 | 2.1 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | 1 |\n| 20 | Algeria | 2017 | UNSD |  |  | 222.3 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | 1 |  |  |  | 1 |\n| 21 | Andorra | 2019 | UNSD | 1 |  | 20.2 |  | 20.2 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | 1 |\n| 22 | Antigua and Barbuda | 2021 | UNSD |  |  |  |  | 2.4 |  |  |  |  |  | 2.4 |  |  |  |  |  |  | 1 |\n| 23 | Argentina | 2019 | UNSD | 0.36 |  | 1914.4 |  | 5354.9 | 5354.9 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | 1 |\n| 24 | Australia | 2021 | OECD | 0.99 |  | 2148.9 |  | 2167.8 |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  | 1 |\n| 25 | Austr